Based on Overpass API
---------------------

overpass-rust is a Rust reimplementation of Overpass API, which is
Copyright 2008-2018 Roland Olbricht et al. and licensed under the GNU Affero
General Public License, version 3 or later:
https://github.com/drolbr/Overpass-API

The authors of Overpass API did not write or endorse this program.

Modified from Overpass API 0.7.62 from 30 October 2026 on:

- Translated from C++ to Rust, in whole or in part:
    src/exec/eval/rhr.rs     core/geometry.cc, core/four_field_index.cc
    src/exec/areageom.rs     core/type_area.h, data/collect_members.cc,
                             statements/make_area.cc
    src/geo.rs               core/index_computations.h
    src/exec/query.rs        statements/around.cc, statements/polygon_query.cc
- docs/spec/ describes behaviour extracted from the C++ sources, and the rest
  of the program follows those specs.

